# Auto detect text files and perform LF normalization
* text=auto

# Geospatial data: force LF in the working tree, everywhere.
#
# Without this, `* text=auto` classifies .geojson as text and converts it to
# CRLF on Windows checkout. Measured on comunas.geojson: the stored blob is
# 72,076,912 bytes while the checked-out file is 73,907,118 — a delta of
# 1,830,206 bytes, exactly one per line. Any SHA-256 computed on Windows would
# then disagree with Linux CI and with raw.githubusercontent.com, which
# matters because the catalog publishes checksums.
*.geojson  text eol=lf
*.json     text eol=lf
*.topojson text eol=lf

# Keep the data tree out of GitHub's language statistics, and out of diffs
# that no human is going to read.
data/**   linguist-generated=true
*.geojson -diff
